    "body": "Cannot start #1885 because its required dependency #1883 is not implemented yet.\nUpstream main is 6f8b309dcea9ea2c367ecfa53261ed140881bab3.\nA case-insensitive search for waterjet across crates at that commit finds no matches.\nThe operation registry has no WaterjetProfile, and the posting machine-kind match has no Waterjet kind.\n#1883 is open. No open PR title or body references waterjet, WaterjetProfile, #1883, or #1885.\nThe waterjet posting-gate fixtures need that operation and its CL records first.\nI made no claim and changed no repository files. Resume #1885 after the prerequisite is available.\n",
